{"format":"flashcards-maths","version":1,"matieres":[{"nom":"Maths - 2nde","paquets":[{"nom":"2nde · Calcul algébrique","cartes":[{"recto":"$(a + b)^2$","verso":"$a^2 + 2ab + b^2$"},{"recto":"$(a - b)^2$","verso":"$a^2 - 2ab + b^2$"},{"recto":"$(a + b)(a - b)$","verso":"$a^2 - b^2$"},{"recto":"Développer $(2x + 3)^2$","verso":"$4x^2 + 12x + 9$"},{"recto":"Développer $(x - 5)^2$","verso":"$x^2 - 10x + 25$"},{"recto":"Développer $(3x - 2)(3x + 2)$","verso":"$9x^2 - 4$"},{"recto":"Factoriser $x^2 - 9$","verso":"$(x - 3)(x + 3)$"},{"recto":"Factoriser $x^2 + 6x + 9$","verso":"$(x + 3)^2$"},{"recto":"Factoriser $4x^2 - 12x$","verso":"$4x(x - 3)$"},{"recto":"Factoriser $(x + 1)(2x - 3) + (x + 1)(x + 4)$","verso":"$(x + 1)[(2x - 3) + (x + 4)] = (x + 1)(3x + 1)$"},{"recto":"Mettre au même dénominateur $\\dfrac{1}{x} + \\dfrac{1}{x + 1}$","verso":"$\\dfrac{x + 1 + x}{x(x + 1)} = \\dfrac{2x + 1}{x(x + 1)}$"},{"recto":"Pour quelles valeurs de $x$ le quotient $\\dfrac{1}{x - 2}$ existe-t-il ?","verso":"Pour $x \\neq 2$ (valeur interdite : celle qui annule le dénominateur)"},{"recto":"$\\sqrt{a^2}$ pour $a$ réel","verso":"$|a|$"},{"recto":"$\\sqrt{a}\\times\\sqrt{b}$ et $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$ ($a \\geq 0$, $b > 0$)","verso":"$\\sqrt{ab}$ et $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$"},{"recto":"Simplifier $\\sqrt{50}$","verso":"$\\sqrt{25 \\times 2} = 5\\sqrt{2}$"}]}]}]}